    "Name": "Lightning HCV",
    "Details": "The Lightning was designed for the Star League by Curtiss Industries as a hovercraft combat vehicle designed to take down slow BattleMechs and vehicles. Some commanders would combine several Lightnings into a temporary compact unit to crush the hostile line, using their maneuverability to break up formations. A interesting feature of the Lightning is a low wing mounted on the rear of the vehicle that increases the vehicle's stability at high speed. \n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 11/17 hexes / 330/510 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       110     20\n<b>Left</b>          85     20\n<b>Right</b>        85     20\n<b>Rear</b>         60     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      340     80</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color>",
    "Icon": "Lightning"
  },
